.TH "user:delete" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
user:delete \- Removes a framework user account.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php user:delete
\fIuser_id_or_username\fR [\-\-json] [\-\-app=\fIAPP\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Permanently removes a user record from spp_users and purges related role assignments.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Outputs results in structured JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-\-app =\fIAPP\fR
Targets a specific application context.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Enforces system administrator protection, removes spp_user_roles links, and deletes the row from spp_users.
